# corpus/successor-staging
profile own
summary update take direct
failure stop typed Stop
scope.begin outer
new a A
object original item=a
bind original_bind original
scope.begin consumer
call.enter action update original
scope.begin attempt
new b B
stage action item b
scope.unwind attempt stop
catch Stop caught
emit c
staged final_field action item
object updated item=final_field
succ updated
succ.take updated
call.exit action updated
use updated
check c
scope.end consumer
check cB
call.enter failed_action update original
new f F
stage failed_action item f
call.exit failed_action - stop
catch Stop caught_again
check cBF
use original
scope.end outer
check cBFA
